              <td>Omar Saleh · Officer</td>
              <td>Released <span class="font-mono">24 packs</span> to available</td>
              <td>Ready for customer allocation</td>
              <td><span class="status-good"><span class="status-dot-good"></span>good</span> (released)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="font-mono">13 May 2026 09:30</td>
              <td>North Quay Loading Bay 12</td>
              <td class="font-mono">B-691 (10), B-692 (10)</td>
              <td>Order O-290 allocation</td>
              <td>Priya Nair · Dispatcher</td>
              <td>Packed <span class="font-mono">20 packs</span> for Cedar Clinic</td>
              <td>Consignment pre-advice sent</td>
              <td><span class="status-good"><span class="status-dot-good"></span>good</span> (consigned)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="font-mono">13 May 2026 10:14</td>
